  "steps": [
    "Arrange the dates in 4 rows onto a butter paper. Using a heavy object press them down so that they stick to each other.",
    "Spread peanut butter onto the date bark and freeze it for 10-15 mins.",
    "Until then melt your dark chocolate in a microwave or using double boiler method.",
    "Spread the dark choc onto the peanut butter layer and garnish with peanuts and sprinkle sea salt.",
    "Keep it in the freezer for 10 mins and its ready to eat.",
    "You can store it in the fridge for upto two weeks."
